sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client
    participant Route
    participant Controller
    participant Service
    participant Database
    participant Helper_emailHelper

    Client->>+Route: POST /resend-verify-email
    Route->>+Controller: AuthController.resendVerifyEmail
    Note over Controller: 📥 Extract from req.body&#58; {email}
    Controller->>+Service: AuthService.resendVerifyEmailToDB()
    Service->>+Database: User.findOne({ email })
    Note over Database: 💾 Database Query&#58; MongoDB থেকে data fetch করা হচ্ছে
    Database->>-Service: result
    Service->>Helper_emailHelper: emailHelper()
    Helper_emailHelper-->>Service: result
    Service->>-Controller: result
    Controller->>-Route: StatusCodes.OK - Verification code has been resent to your email.
    Route-->>Client: Response
    Note over Client: ✅ Verification code has been resent to your email.
